- ✅ `[GeneratedRegex]` source-generated regex with `#if NET7_0_OR_GREATER` guard — best practice
- ✅ `stackalloc` buffer in `Concat(char, ReadOnlySpan<char>)` — zero-heap allocation
- ✅ `RegexOptions.Compiled` fallback for older TFMs stored in `static readonly` fields
- ✅ `string.Concat(ReadOnlySpan, ReadOnlySpan)` span-based helper

