| Severity | Count | Top Issue |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| 🟡 Moderate | 6 | LINQ on hot-path (`Cast/Select/All`) — ~4 enumerator+delegate allocations per `Humanize()` call |
| ℹ️ Info | 2 | Unsealed classes (3), `.Split()` array (2) |

**Estimated per-call allocation cost of `Humanize()` on a PascalCase string:** ~8-12 objects (LINQ enumerators, delegates, intermediate strings, params array if `Pascalize` is chained). For a CMS rendering **hundreds of strings per page**, this translates to **thousands of avoidable GC allocations per request**.

**Priority fix order:** #2 (LINQ→foreach loop) > #4 (substring) > #5 (params overload) > #6 (Pascalize rewrite) > #1 (All→foreach) > #3 (culture) > #8 (sealed) > #7 (Split)

